15     The most sinister of all the demons that ever existed was
15 Beldan. Very little is known about Beldan/ but what is known is
15 both horrifying and fascinating. It is rumoured that Beldan was the
15 greatest Wizard that ever lived. Some of the most powerful spells
15 that have ever been known were brought into existence by his power.
15 Early in his life/ it is believed that he was possessed by a demon
15 that was created by his own hand. The demon was so powerful that it
15 possed Beldan fully/ and with Beldan's awesome spell arsenal at his
15 command/ he became the self proclaimed ruler of Garnloken.
15
09     Beldan was a cruel and evil ruler that caused suffering and
09 hardships for years to come. Salvation seemed only a dream/ for
09 Beldan did not seem to be getting any older/ and some feared that
09 with the supreme power of the demon within him/ Beldan would never
09 die. €
13
13     Decades passed with no hope in sight. Until one day/ a hopeful
13 young soldier ventured into the catacombs were Beldan lived and
13 slayed him for good. The land prospered once more.
15          
15     The chronicle continues fifty years later/ the year that saw
15 the death of the brave warrior who had slain Beldan. The time as it
15 is known to the people of that age is the fifteenth change of the
15 moon in the seventy third change of the sun. €
09
09     Let me take a moment to introduce you the the hero of the
09 Chronicles. He is the grandson of the lengendary warrior who had
09 slain Beldan. Born some thirty years later/ he was born into a
09 ruling family of Garnloken. He was raised by his mother until the
09 age of five. His parents saw in him the potential to be a great
09 ruler. His generation was expected to see the rise of a greater
09 empire/ one that would encompass the entire world/ including the
09 less-civilied but willing Carrions.  
07
07  He was sent to southern Garnloken to be trained. His trainers
07 were only two/ a Wizard from Garnloken and a Fighter from Carrion.
07 As a powerful wizard he would be trusted and admired by the
07 Garnlokens and as a powerful fighter/ he would win the respect of
07 the Carrions as well. €
13
13     By his twentieth year/ he was ready to win the trust of the
13 people. He was able to solve many difficulties for the Garnloken's
13 and conquer many quest's for the Carrions. He was rapidly becoming
13 the Hero that his Grandfather had been. 
14
14     After returning from a Quest in Carrion/ he was summoned to
14 his Grandfather's side. Upon his death bed/ the king confides in
14 his grandson all of his wisdom. He spends hours on end telling him
14 of his grand adventures as a boy/ his conquest to slay Beldan/ and
14 his subsequent ascent to the throne. 
09
09   He has lived a full live/ save one horrifying event. He has only
09 one wish that he wants to see fulfilled before his death. The
09 carrying out of that request is the event upon which the Manifest
09 Chronicles is unveiled.€
15     
15    The request concerns a cave outside the city of Krystax that
15 was discovered shortly after Beldan's demise/ a cave known as "Dan-
15 Sur"/ or "Catacomb of Despair". The king's only son ventured into
15 that cave one summer morning/ and was never seen again. Armies of
15 men were sent to find the prince. None returned. The mightiest
15 wizard in the land was asked to unveil the secrets of the cave. The
15 wizard was at a loss to explain the disappearances/ but was aware
15 that a magic far beyond his own was at work. Dozens of other young
15 men were lost/ bravely trying to recover the prince. Finally/ the
15 king was forced to seal off the cave for good/ but never dispelling
15 any naive hopes that his son would ever be found alive. It was a
15 void in the King's soul that was never able to be filled. Years
15 later he was able to have another son/ whose own son sits listening
15 intently to his grandfather's heartfelt plea that his long lost son
15 be brought to him before he passes away.€ 
09
09     The Chronicle is your's to complete. You have been in traning
09 all of your life/ and this quest will test you to your limits. You
09 are joined by your life long friend/ who is as skilled as you at
09 magic and combat. One of you will decide to take the spellbook/ and
09 the other will take the weapons. Should you complete your quest/ you
09 will discover the secrets of the Catacombs. Every move you make
09 will be recorded for all time/ in the Manifest Chronicle.€
